From 8bff04daa5bbf9ba60e9d4d37e360815feaf3e1d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ientzy <ientzy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 13:14:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] feat(qwen4_exp): prompt-lookup rounds on the Host PLE
 decode path

A round whose newest tokens repeat an earlier stretch of the sequence verifies the tokens that
followed it instead of MTP proposals, running one MTP step. NINFER_PROMPT_LOOKUP=<match length>
enables it for single-lane decode.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
